model flows_conv_rule
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.2 G1 S-7 (#211, plan §5): a converted flows is cut; in a rule, flows(x, s) in PLN reads on as a membership test and the grammar stops at at (LOAD-PARSE, choice C-1 (a)). Its twin flows_conv_rule_twin.tally writes the sum over the movements of a def keyed by the movement that rounds each at its day."

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit EUR: currency minor 0.01
place wallet: accounts EUR lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input fx: num PLN/EUR
input d1: date
input amt: money EUR
input mo: month

move in1: transfers
  on d1
  leg cash from world to wallet amount amt

def total: money PLN at reader
  rule base = flows(wallet, mo) in PLN at fx half-up

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  d1 = 2026-03-05 "s"
  amt = 100.00 EUR "s"
  mo = 2026-03 "s"
  fx = 4.0 "s"
  opening[wallet] = 0.00 EUR at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask q: total law 2026-06-01
